ROUND 3 — ARENA AI, test/evidence engineer:
Inspect the same SHA and run only local/no-cost tests. Add mock contract tests only if the user has approved test-file changes; otherwise propose exact tests and run existing tests. Capture final outgoing payload at the HTTP boundary. Distinguish application defects from provider/API failures. No live paid calls. Append exact command/result evidence with secrets removed.

